f Slavic peoples (known as tvorog) are smoother, creamier, mildly tangy, and more homogeneous in texture."]],"src":"wikipedia","actions":[{"kind":"globe","hash":"ingredient-tvorog"},{"kind":"wiki","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tvorog"}],"sections":[{"h":"Where it's cooked with","count":3,"groups":[["Russian cuisine","cuisine/russian-cuisine",[["Syrniki","dish/syrniki"],["Vatrushka","dish/vatrushka"]]],["Ukrainian cuisine","cuisine/ukrainian-cuisine",[["Syrniki","dish/syrniki"],["Vatrushka","dish/vatrushka"]]],["Belarusian cuisine","cuisine/belarusian-cuisine",[["Syrniki","dish/syrniki"]]]]},{"h":"Often cooked with","links":[["Egg","ingredient/egg"],["Sugar","ingredient/sugar"],["Cottage cheese","ingredient/cottage-cheese"],["Quark (dairy product)","ingredient/quark-dairy-product"],["Raisin","ingredient/raisin"],["Vanilla extract","ingredient/vanilla-extract"],["Wheat flour","ingredient/wheat-flour"]]}]},"dish/tube-rice-pudding":{"t":"dish","r":"dish/tube-rice-pudding","n":"Tube rice pudding","c":"#ede6da","crumb":[["Dishes","dishes"]],"sub":"Dish from Taiwan cuisine","dot":"#f0b340","intro":[["Tube rice pudding is a Taiwanese dish consisting of a stir-fried glutinous rice mixture that is seasoned and steamed in a bamboo tube. Tube rice pudding is a cylindrical shape caused by the steaming process in a tube.  Though regionally variable, the dish is typically served with shiitake, minced pork, shallots, and complemented by sweet chili sauce. The dish is considered one of the national dishes of Taiwan and was featured on the 40 of the best Taiwanese foods and drinks by CNN Travel."]],"src":"wikipedia","actions":[{"kind":"globe","hash":"dish-tube-rice-pudding"},{"kind":"wiki","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tube_rice_pudding"}],"sections":[{"h":"Where it's from","links":[["Taiwan cuisine","cuisine/taiwan-cuisine"]]},{"h":"Ingredients","count":1,"links":[["Shiitake","ingredient/shiitake"]]},{"h":"Cook it","rows":[{"name":"Cooking in Chinglish","ref":"site/coo